Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:06.13,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Emperor set the laptop \Nrecovery time to 23:55 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:10.22,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's our best window to create \Nan opening for as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:13.65,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll cut electricity supply at 23:55 PM \Nand invade the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:18.42,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Operation will begin at... 23:30 PM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:19.81,Default,Volunteers,0,0,0,,Feint Operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.25,Default,Yagihashi Team,0,0,0,,Power Station Invasion Operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:26.88,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,43)}Commence Feint Operation and \NPower Station Invasion Operation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:25.80,Default,All,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:39.10,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Both Team Feint and Team PS are on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:42.68,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Huh? You can see Team PS too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:45.02,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,You sure we even need my Presentation Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:48.41,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I just happen to be able to \Nsee their location for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:50.57,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I won't be able to see them through buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:53.23,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Your Right will be our main lifeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:56.51,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,By the way, how're things on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:00.87,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Up and running, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:06.93,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The side monitors display each team's \Noutgoing communication devices, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.93,0:01:10.48,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Yeah, their messages will show up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.38,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What about the two monitors in the middle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:15.78,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,The bottom one's for me \Nto send them messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:17.47,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'll type messages in the notepad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:17.43,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H67&\fs20\t(\fs12)\move(453,175,477,82)}For real
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:21.60,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H67&\fs12\pos(477,82)\bord0}For real
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:20.20,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,and display them on their \Nincoming communication devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:20.81,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H67&\fs12\bord0\frz90\pos(295,303)}For real
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:25.11,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,The same goes for the other way around, \Nso we can communicate back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:25.11,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H50&\fs12\bord0\frz90\pos(295,303)}Reply
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:25.11,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H67&\fs12\pos(477,82)}Reply
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:26.83,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What about the top monitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.53,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,It's... for operation purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:35.95,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(214,53)}T-minus goal time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:44.46,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:47.13,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:51.80,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:14.05,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad2\4c&H41382A&\4a&H97&\c&H000000&\1a&H50&\frx8\fry10\frz356.2\pos(494,30)}Hibiya Park Yuraku Gate\N- Koya Shimomura\N- Shuji Nihonyanagi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:14.05,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Team Feint A, Koya Shimomura \Nand Shuji Nihonyanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:27.08,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,So they move if we get close, \Nand stop when we back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:32.08,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,We can't get {\i1}too{\i0} far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:35.66,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta stay close \Nif we wanna lure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:37.74,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad2\4c&H41382A&\4a&H97&\c&H000000&\1a&H50&\pos(372,29)}Hibiya Park Naka-Saiwai Gate\N- Makoto Agatsuma\N- Hikari Ebina
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:40.42,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Team Feint B, Makoto \NAgatsuma and Hikari Ebina.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:42.64,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Leading puppets from Naka-Saiwai Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.83,Default,Agatsuma,0,0,0,,It's not too difficult. We just need \Nto stay calm and we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.61,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.12,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,These two groups will \Nlure puppets in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.21,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad2\4c&H41382A&\4a&H97&\c&H000000&\1a&H50&\frz353.5\pos(335,25)\frx11\fry357}Oi Thermal Power Station\N- Tojuro Yagihashi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:56.80,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad2\4c&H41382A&\4a&H97&\c&H000000&\1a&H50&\frz5.486\pos(488,101)\frx20\fry350}Shinagawa\NThermal Power Station\N- Kazuhiko Sato\N- Eren Kunashiri
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:04:01.04,Default-Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Team PS is also underway at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:05.39,Default-Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,At exactly 23:55 PM, as the \NEmperor recovers the laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:07.98,Default-Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,they'll cut power lines and \Nhalt electricity supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:14.40,Default-Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Team Emperor, on standby at Kasumi Gate, \Nwill enter the Emperor's tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:14.40,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,1)\fs17\pos(321,304)\3c&HDCDCDC&\fnArial}Kasumi Gate
