Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:23.53,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Team Feint's moving without a hitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:28.46,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Looks like Team PS has \Nencountered puppets as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.41,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:45.25,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Since I won't be able to \Ngreet the Emperor myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:48.89,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I suppose you'll have to bear my wrath...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:52.77,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,as I avenge Sudo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:00.90,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,No one gave you permission \Nto start yet, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:04.71,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I still have time to cut the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:06.68,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,No need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:13.05,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Now, here's a seemingly \Nnormal black cloth...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:22.96,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Not quite as exciting \Nwhen this is your audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:27.32,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,But now that I know that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.35,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,you used my gift in your final act,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:34.68,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to return \Nthe favor, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:39.89,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Welcome to my magic show, dedicated \Nto my friend and the loathsome Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:41.93,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself for a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:45.57,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You all! Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:51.75,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Man, Senpai... \NYour Compliance Right is no joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.62,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I mean it! It's "stupendular"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:55.92,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You mean "stupendous" or "spectacular"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:59.08,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Yeah, that! With your Compliance Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:03.16,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,getting these puppets to cut \Nthe power lines should be no sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:05.99,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I gotta make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.89,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:12.47,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Nothing, I was just thinking about \Nhow you were such a scaredy-cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:14.90,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,but now you're so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.49,0:06:18.00,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Are you saying I can't grow up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:20.36,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I promised myself I won't run away anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:22.13,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:23.37,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.53,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:33.46,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Compliance Right didn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.75,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does he have his own will?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:42.59,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Take my bucket special!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:48.26,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Hold him down and beat him up \Nuntil he can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:50.44,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You heard her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:51.79,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:53.31,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:06.74,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:08.26,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:11.27,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Umm... 23:40 PM!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:14.76,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,So we've got 15 minutes until \Nwe need to cut the power lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:31.89,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Perfect. Keep it up. Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.52,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Shimomura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:45.95,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,This puppet's not like the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:50.32,Default,Agatsuma,0,0,0,,It's like it has its own will... \Nlike it's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.12,Default,Agatsuma,0,0,0,,Shoot—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:07:59.88,Next Ep Title - Lower,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H908285&\bord0\frz15\pos(123,55)}All good here. Agatsuma
