Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:01.59,Next Ep Title - Lower,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H908285&\bord0\frz16\pos(78,178)}Agatsuma dead. Ebina
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:04.88,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Damn it! They got Shimomura and Agatsuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:07.98,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,They've lured the puppets \Nfar enough from the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:11.39,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Tell the two who are left to evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:12.80,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:21.18,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Eren Senpai... Call me stupid, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.81,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What? Is it something bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:28.62,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Well, um...I don't see any \Npower lines here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:31.03,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:34.66,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,It may be here somewhere, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:38.04,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding! \NWe have less than 15 minutes left!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:40.14,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I guess we better look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:42.54,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,But how are we supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:47.41,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Wait! Let's contact Gobo using \Nthe device he gave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.41,0:08:51.24,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,He'll be able to tell us \Nwhere the power lines are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:54.51,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You've got the outgoing device, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:56.88,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Hey, great call!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:02.35,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I forgot it at the coffee shop \Nwhen we were on standby...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.53,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What?! Are you {\i1}stupid{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:06.86,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?! \NYou're kidding, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:10.49,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Let's see, how else can we contact him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:14.17,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,He designated separate devices for \Noutgoing and incoming communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:15.41,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,There's no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:20.80,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I have the incoming device, but \Nthis is no good to send messages...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:24.64,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Senpai, could you go back and get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:25.54,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:30.59,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You'll be safe with the Compliance Right. \NYou just need to go back the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.64,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,When you find the device, contact Gobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.90,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'll be here on standby \Nwith the incoming device.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:39.22,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Just ask him to display \Nwhere the power lines are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.48,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,And I'll be there in a split!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:44.23,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,But what are you gonna do until then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:46.03,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'll look for it on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:48.31,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Who knows, I may even find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:52.71,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,It took us over 10 minutes to get here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:55.37,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,so it'll be past 23:50 PM by the time \Nyou get to the coffee shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:59.46,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You won't make it back in time, \Nso stay put there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:02.41,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Just send me the message \Nand I'll take it from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:08.13,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,But you don't have the Compliance Right \Nto send puppets to cut the power lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.26,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Look, I'll figure it out...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:13.09,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.61,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Fine, I suppose I'll trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:19.10,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Oh, just one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.90,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'll give you my phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.52,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You mean in case it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:30.19,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Thanks! Don't delete it by accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:32.83,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I won't make that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.49,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Anyways, don't be too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:44.90,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.81,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Almost time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:59.72,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.68,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,23:52 PM!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:05.22,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I made it... three more minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:07.90,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I need to hurry and find that device.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:11.11,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Hang on, what?! Three minutes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:15.36,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,How will he make it to the \Npower lines in three minutes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:38.53,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I've never had such a reactionless \Naudience. What a bore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:43.43,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll come over \Nand join me on stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:49.27,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Man, I'm really stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.95,0:11:54.49,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,But those guys stuck it out \Nwith an idiot like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:58.96,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,They never gave up on me and \Ntreated me as an equal through it all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.57,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Even though I'm no good for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:07.28,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Not just Sane. Eren Senpai, too. \NThey all trusted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.58,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Can't ask for much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:13.60,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,How did I get so lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:17.34,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\b0\an7\fs18\pos(428,180)\frz8.289\3c&HD6E9E8&\c&H898894&}Ippy-hiko! Here's\Nthe location of the\Npower lines!\NIt's long but be\Nsure to look it over!\NFor real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:22.82,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Oh good, Eren Senpai made it \Nto the coffee shop. That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:29.38,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I finally got a girl to take my number!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:31.72,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Not that I can use it, but oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:39.07,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,A radius of 20 meters... This should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:44.70,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I wonder, Sane... if you realized \Nwhat I was hiding from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:49.06,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Or did I do a good job at masking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.21,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I figured if I'm gonna be useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.25,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I might as well play the part \Nof the happy old me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:13:00.13,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,That way, if you're ever down, you can \Ntalk to me and go back to the good days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:03.38,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,And now that I've gained this power...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:05.14,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'll make it count.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:07.31,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,At least this once, at the end of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:07.85,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(400,1)\pos(298,62)\frz21.14}Prime\NRight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:08.89,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\bord0\fs13\shad0\frz17\an8\pos(273,100)\frx10\fry16}Prime Right Access Denied\N You are not permitted to\N acquire a Prime Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:11.73,georgia,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,1)\bord0\frz5\pos(338,281)}Prime\NRight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:16.69,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'll smile believing in our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.69,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You better win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:35.20,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You all can cut the power lines for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.37,0:13:42.13,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Catch ya later, Saneatsu. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:45.72,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Prime Right under \Nthe Production Attribute...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:47.72,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Explosion Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.63,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,The power's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:00.83,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.37,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Laptop recovery confirmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:19.34,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Kazuhiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.87,0:14:22.01,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Al right! Souma, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.01,0:14:23.00,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:24.30,Next Ep Title - Lower,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H908285&\bord0\frz8.252\pos(146,127)\b0}Agatsuma dead. Ebina
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:24.51,Next Ep Title - Lower,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H908285&\bord0\frz8.252\b0\move(142,89,121,-8,21,188)}Agatsuma dead. Ebina
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:24.68,Next Ep Title - Lower,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H908285&\bord0\frz10\b0\move(189,278,173,131,23,0)}Entering the Emperor's tower. Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:25.72,Next Ep Title - Lower,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H908285&\bord0\frz8.252\b0\pos(172,137)}Entering the Emperor's tower. Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:28.93,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Commence invasion of the Emperor's tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:33.39,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(318,93,318,104)\fs23\t(\fs26)}Commence Invasion of Emperor's Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:35.77,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Materialization!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:52.54,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}After the puppets are lured away, \NTeam Emperor draws in on the tower.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.07,0:14:57.79,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,So that's... the Emperor's tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:03.94,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Souma! Rika! You two keep the puppets away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:04.93,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:09.89,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,You won't have to worry about getting \Nshot down as long as you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:21.52,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,Don't get too rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:23.69,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Same to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:35.34,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}The tower may be equipped with \Nan in-house power generator,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:38.42,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}but we won't be noticed \Nwhile the power's down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:43.01,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}The longer the Emperor takes to react, \Nthe greater our advantage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.62,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Wanna block routes connecting lower levels?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:50.80,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:53.64,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.10,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ryuta! The stairs are over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:00.52,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:05.24,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:07.88,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:11.08,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,We're clear of any \Nconnecting routes over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.45,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Clear here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:15.28,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:35.14,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They're here, just as we thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.56,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Saaya, time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.97,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,23:55:40 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.39,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The puppets really {\i1}are{\i0} corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.39,0:16:54.90,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They don't bleed when cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.49,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:58.96,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:05.32,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.39,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They're here, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:15.91,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It's fine, we'll force our way through!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:18.27,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ryuta, follow us and protect Omi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:20.45,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Can you clear the path with me, Saaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:21.45,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:30.61,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Nice! Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.18,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,There's the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:48.66,Default,Puppet 1,0,0,0,,As I thought... intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:51.20,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It {\i0}talked{\i1}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:52.63,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Is it not a puppet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:56.67,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Ya gonna shoot me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:17:59.22,Default,Puppet 1,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.57,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.52,0:18:18.39,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,It's... not bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:21.70,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,But it {\i1}looks{\i0} just like a living human...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:25.33,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I guess the servants are \Nmuch more well-made...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:32.11,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:35.35,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,It's still only 23:57 PM! \NWe can still make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:36.88,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:47.89,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Does this mean... we can't \Nget in without a password?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:53.82,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Damn it... The doors seem to be thick steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.74,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It's too thick for even Ryuta \Nto break down instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:19:00.05,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I try to break the pass code?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:03.11,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, there could be an entry limit...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:05.32,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have less than a minute left...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:06.53,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}What now?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.99,0:19:11.32,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,By exercising the combined power \Nof multiple Prime Rights,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.67,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,I have extended one minute to ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:15.63,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Emperor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:19.77,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,If you agree to negotiations, \Nyou will be granted access.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:24.08,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,However, this will involve exercising \Nthe Prime Right of Negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:28.32,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,By rule, all negotiation results will be \Nabsolute, and resistance will be futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:29.61,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Do you wish to proceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:40.04,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,You will renounce your Parental \NAuthority in return for access.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:42.41,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.05,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:48.67,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Emperor's tactic against \NParental Authority...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:52.88,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was to make me renounce it \Nwith their Negotiation Right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:57.19,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}No wonder they wanted \Nto lure me to them...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:20:00.63,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I agree, I won't be able to \Nuse Parental Authority.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:04.27,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I refuse, I won't be able \Nto meet the Emperor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:06.04,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:12.02,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Fine, I agree! I renounce \Nmy Parental Authority!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:18.45,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Negotiation complete. \NI will now open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:24.05,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ryuta, the doors are opening. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.37,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm all set. Whenever they're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:32.14,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ryuta...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:35.01,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'm always the one \Nputting you in a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:39.26,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And now... I've lost my only power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:42.28,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it. We're best friends, remember?
